            "keyPoints": [
                "Snorkel runs millions of agent simulations per month for clients in regulated industries.",
                "Environments bundle databases, policy docs, domain tools and simulated users — tau-bench style tasks at enterprise scale.",
                "Vincent Chen (Snorkel founding team) argues cost, latency and reasoning-trace quality must become standard eval signals alongside accuracy.",
                "Even the best coding agents fail senior-level tasks over 70% of the time — top score is 29.1% tasteful solve rate.",
                "Simulation data trains as well as it tests: a 4B model trained with RL in FinQA beat the 235B model from the same family.",
                "Snorkel treats benchmarks as software: versioned, CI/CD-managed, re-runnable on every agent change."
            ],
